{"strongs": "H0050", "word": "אֲבִישׁוּעַ", "translit": "a.vi.shu.a", "root": "אבה", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "my father is rescue", "definition": "אֲבִישׁוּעַ proper name, masculine ( my father is rescue , or is opulence (compare שׁוֺעַ rich Job 34:19 also שׁוּעַ Job 36:19 ? but see שׁוע ); Lag BN 75 thinks from אֲבֶן (= בֶּן ) + שׁוע compare ᵐ5 Ἀβεσσουε 1Chr 8:4 ) 1. a son of Phinehas 1Chr 5:30 ; 1Chr 5:31 ; 1Chr 6:35 ; Ezra 7:5 . 2. a Benjamite, son of Bela 1Chr 8:4 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB40')\">BDB40</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H50')\">H50</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB39')\">BDB39</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB41')\">BDB41</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֲבִישׁוּעַ</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>my father is rescue</highlight>, or <highlight>is opulence</highlight> (compare <bdbheb>שׁוֺעַ</bdbheb> <highlight>rich</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 34:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,19)\">Job 34:19</ref> also <bdbheb>שׁוּעַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 36:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,19)\">Job 36:19</ref> ? but see  <bdbheb><reflink>שׁוע</reflink></bdbheb>); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 75</sup></lookup> thinks from <bdbheb>אֲבֶן</bdbheb> (= <bdbheb>בֶּן</bdbheb>) + <bdbheb>שׁוע</bdbheb> compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἀβεσσουε</grk> <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,4)\">1Chr 8:4</ref>) <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> a son of Phinehas <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:30\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,30)\">1Chr 5:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:31\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,31)\">1Chr 5:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:35\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,35)\">1Chr 6:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 7:5\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(15,7,5)\">Ezra 7:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> a Benjamite, son of Bela <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,4)\">1Chr 8:4</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Job 34:19", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 34, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Job 36:19", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 36, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "1Chr 8:4", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 8, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "1Chr 5:30", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 5, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "1Chr 5:31", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 5, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "1Chr 6:35", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 6, "verse": 35}, {"raw": "Ezra 7:5", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 7, "verse": 5}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אֲבִישׁוּעַ", "שׁוֺעַ", "שׁוּעַ", "שׁוע", "אֲבֶן", "בֶּן", "ᵐ5"], "aramaic": [], "greek": ["Ἀβεσσουε"], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Lag", "Sept"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB40", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}